# Sample 14 — Explicit range
#
# `range auto` (the default) fits the axis to whatever is plotted.
# An explicit `range LOW to HIGH` instead sets authoritative axis
# limits — useful for holding a fixed frame across a series of related
# diagrams, e.g. every stage of a grading study on the same axis.

diagram "Explicit axis bounds" {
  range 3 kA to 13 kA

  below "Emergency load" must 5 kA margin 10%
  above "Minimum fault" must 8 kA margin 10%

  selected "Setting" midpoint step 0.05 kA
}
